                <pb facs="0561" n="511" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg511"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure in No.
                    77.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Fourteenth article of Turko-Persian
                    treaty.</hi></head>
                <p>Persian subjects in Turkey and Turkish subjects in Persia shall enjoy exactly the
                    same rights as the subjects of the most favored nations in all matters which are
                    not mentioned in the present treaty, and in case the Persian Government shall
                    not fulfill any one of the clauses of this treaty, the Turkish Government will
                    act, on its part, in the same manner.</p>
                <p>The 21 Zegadé, 1292, corresponding to A. D. 1875.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
